{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y弱于X的地方是音乐细节和情绪回环。X对声部变化、音乐起伏、船与水的意象有更细密的对应，情绪层次也更丰富。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏让主叙事和感受词各有位置，几秒内更容易抓住每段发生了什么，也更容易理解他为什么从克制、放松逐渐走向期待、不安，最后接受无法保证永远。X的加亮关键词和音乐细节更有层次，尤其水波、小船、声部变化形成了贯穿全曲的意象回环；但感受词过于密集，扫读时容易分散注意力。综合普通观众边听边看的实际体验，我选Y，但X在音乐表现力和情绪细腻度上确实有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c11dec2a-e51d-43c5-86a3-d2fd7cdcbe24", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T022050032286Z", "elapsed_seconds": 116.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:22:46.901102+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "519a64a7d4c2b11dbd3ac7ef830b630c4be9560bfe8b8b8a90ab40cb106391b8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g